                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tyrannical, despotic or oppressive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "30c8ff65-524d-438b-96ac-fb8cba6d96f6",
                                                "sense_id": "f998636d-8fa8-36db-be63-2fa7292f5fde",
                                                "text": "[…] that Elfe,\nThat man and beast with powre imperious\nSubdeweth to his kingdome tyrannous:"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fcc6b5d8-2c32-4dc9-89d9-fee7ec4a3ec0",
                                                "sense_id": "f998636d-8fa8-36db-be63-2fa7292f5fde",
                                                "text": "Yield up, O love, thy crown and hearted throne\nTo tyrannous hate!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f7dc7cc-22b3-4d95-b51f-be154d6cc724",
                                                "sense_id": "f998636d-8fa8-36db-be63-2fa7292f5fde",
                                                "text": "It is extraordinary that as the wicked arts of this regicide and tyrannous faction increase in number, variety, and atrocity, the desire of punishing them becomes more and more faint […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "add5b727-e2e8-4503-86cd-ca79592e20cb",
                                                "sense_id": "f998636d-8fa8-36db-be63-2fa7292f5fde",
                                                "text": "As life wears on and finds no rest,\nThe individual in each breast\nIs tyrannous to sunder them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
